 "name_en": "Sales Order Processing with Invoice List and Collective Billing (BKZ)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Sales Order Processing with Invoice List and Collective Billing (BKZ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0b0ab66ae8224de3a564482ba0ed7da4\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0b0ab66ae8224de3a564482ba0ed7da4__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With invoice lists, you can send a list that involves several billing documents to a central payer with special discount applicable at specific time intervals. The process starts with the creation of several standard sales orders for different sold-to parties that share the same payer. After individual billing documents are generated and forwarded to Financial Accounting, invoice lists can be created with reference to multiple billing documents for the central payer. Factoring discount and possible taxes are posted to FI.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item describes the usage of standard sales processing for mass-processing billing. For optimization of shipping costs, all sales orders that are delivered to the same customer are packed into one delivery document. For cost optimization, all deliveries due to be invoiced to the same customer are packed into one invoice document. The revenue is posted to accounting accordingly.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0b0ab66ae8224de3a564482ba0ed7da4__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Sales order processing with invoice lists:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sales orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create deliveries</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create invoice lists</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">Sales order processing with collective billing:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sales orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create deliveries via collective run</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing documents via collective run</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0b0ab66ae8224de3a564482ba0ed7da4__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Optimize cost by collecting customer orders due to be delivered to the same customer in one delivery via a collective run</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Optimize costs by collecting deliveries to the same customer within one invoice via a collective run</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用发票清单和集中开票的销售订单处理 (BKZ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0b0ab66ae8224de3a564482ba0ed7da4\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0b0ab66ae8224de3a564482ba0ed7da4__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过发票清单，您可以将涉及多个开票凭证的清单发送给集中付款方，并以特定时间间隔应用特殊折扣。该流程首先为共享同一付款方的不同售达方创建多个标准销售订单。生成单个开票凭证并将其转发到财务会计后，可以参考集中付款方的多个开票凭证创建发票清单。保理折扣和可能的税收将过账到 FI。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目描述批量处理开票的标准销售处理的使用。为了优化装运成本，将交付给同一客户的所有销售订单打包到一个交货凭证中。为了优化成本，将向同一客户开票的所有交货包装到一个发票凭证中。收入相应地过账到会计核算。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0b0ab66ae8224de3a564482ba0ed7da4__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用发票清单的销售订单处理：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建发票清单</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用集中开票的销售订单处理：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过集中运行创建交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过集中运行创建开票凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0b0ab66ae8224de3a564482ba0ed7da4__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过集中运行，在一次交货中收集要交付给同一客户的客户订单，从而优化成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过集中运行在一个发票中收集向同一客户的交货，从而优化成本</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
